## 2.4 Layout and spacing

- Reference viewport: 402 px wide, with responsive support down to 320 px.
- Horizontal page gutters: 20 px.
- Base spacing system: 4, 8, 12, 16, 20, 24, 32 and 40 px.
- Large cards: 24 px corner radius.
- Dish imagery: 18–20 px corner radius.
- Buttons and input fields: 16–20 px radius or full pill.
- Bottom navigation: floating rounded container, respecting the device safe area.
- Minimum interactive target: 44 × 44 px, ideally 48 × 48 px.
- One main action per screen.
- Fixed bottom action bars must not cover scrollable content.

