## Screen 06 — Explore / restaurant listing

Explore should present a scannable catalogue of restaurants.

Each restaurant card needs:

- Large image.
- Restaurant name.
- Cuisine category.
- Estimated delivery time.
- Delivery fee or applicable promotion.
- Rating with review count, where verified.
- Open, closing soon, closed or unavailable state.

### Filter and sorting flows

Filters: Cuisine, price, rating, delivery time, dietary options, offers and currently open.

Sort: Recommended, fastest delivery, highest rated, lowest delivery fee.

States: Default, filtered, sorted, no results, loading, error, unavailable location.

Edge cases: Applying filters that produce no results must show a “Clear filters” action. Changing the address should refresh available restaurants and remove invalid location-specific assumptions.

