### Configuration logic

Each dish can have zero or more option groups. Groups must support:

- Required single selection.
- Optional single selection.
- Optional multiple selection.
- Minimum and maximum selections.
- Quantity-limited add-ons.
- Price adjustments.
- Variant-specific availability.
- Special instructions.
- Allergen information where available.

### States

Default, configuring, incomplete required options, valid selection, quantity changed, unavailable option, price updated, adding, added, failed add.

### Edge cases

- Required option not selected → Disable Add and identify the missing group.
- Selected add-on sells out → Remove the invalid selection and inform the customer.
- Dish price changes → Show updated price before addition.
- Quantity exceeds available stock → Limit and explain.
- User closes sheet with unsaved customisations → Dismiss without modifying basket.
- Same dish with different customisations → Separate basket line items.
- Same dish with identical configuration → Merge quantities where appropriate.
- Allergens → Display available information without promising an allergen-free environment.

