### Payment exception handling

| Scenario                               | Required behaviour                                        |
| -------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |
| Payment declined                       | Show reason if available, allow another method            |
| OTP / 3DS challenge                    | Preserve checkout and return correctly                    |
| Customer cancels                       | Return to checkout without creating order                 |
| Bank transfer pending                  | Show pending verification, not success                    |
| App closes mid-payment                 | Reconcile on reopen                                       |
| Provider timeout                       | Query payment status before retry                         |
| Debit occurs but no confirmation       | Show “We're checking your payment”                        |
| Duplicate callback                     | Process once                                              |
| Payment succeeds, order creation fails | Reconcile, retry order creation safely or initiate refund |
| Payment succeeds, restaurant rejects   | Refund or resolution workflow                             |
| Amount mismatch                        | Do not accept as a completed order                        |
| Network disconnect                     | Preserve transaction reference and reconcile              |

Do not equate a successful debit with a confirmed restaurant order. Those are separate operational states.

