### AI capabilities

- Understand natural-language food requests.
- Recommend available dishes based on location, price and preferences.
- Explain options and customisations.
- Build a proposed basket.
- Suggest alternatives when something is unavailable.
- Help find suitable meals based on stated dietary preferences.
- Hand off to checkout after explicit customer confirmation.

### AI guardrails

- Never invent restaurants, prices, delivery times or stock availability.
- Use real menu data for recommendations.
- Do not assume dietary safety from incomplete allergen information.
- Never place an order or initiate payment without explicit confirmation.
- Clearly distinguish recommendations from verified restaurant information.
- Fall back to conventional search when the AI service is unavailable.

Critical UX decision: AI recommendations should render as normal Food101 dish cards with Add buttons, not just paragraphs of chatbot text.

# 8. Global state and error design

Every major screen needs a consistent set of system states. These are reusable patterns rather than 25 individually designed error screens.

Loading

Skeletons, not spinners everywhere

Empty

Explain what's missing and what to do

Offline

Preserve work and offer retry

Error

Explain and recover

Success

Confirm the completed action

Pending

Show what is being verified

### Error-copy standards

| Situation            | Recommended copy                           | Action             |
| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ------------------ |
| Empty basket         | “Nothing in your basket yet.”              | Explore food       |
| No search results    | “We couldn't find that dish.”              | Clear filters      |
| No restaurants       | “No restaurants available here right now.” | Change address     |
| Network offline      | “You're offline. Check your connection.”   | Try again          |
| Dish sold out        | “This dish just sold out.”                 | Find similar       |
| Payment declined     | “Your payment didn't go through.”          | Try another method |
| Payment pending      | “We're checking your payment.”             | View status        |
| Restaurant delay     | “Your food is taking a little longer.”     | Track order        |
| Delivery problem     | “Something went wrong with your delivery.” | Get help           |
| Unknown system error | “Something went wrong. Please try again.”  | Retry              |

Never use technical errors such as “500”, “null response”, “invalid mutation” or “payment intent mismatch” in customer-facing copy.

# 9. Cancellation, refunds and disputes

These are not optional flows for a functioning food delivery product.

## Screen 26 — Cancel order

Cancellation eligibility must depend on actual order state and restaurant/platform policy.

Flow: Order details → Cancel order → Reason → Show eligibility and refund implications → Confirm cancellation → Cancellation result.

States: Eligible, cancellation requested, cancelled, not eligible, awaiting approval, request failed.

Do not promise an automatic refund when the order has already entered a non-refundable preparation stage.

## Screen 27 — Refund tracking

Show refund amount, reason, original payment method, processing status, estimated timeframe where supported, and support reference.

States: Requested, under review, approved, initiated, processing, completed, rejected, failed.

A refund initiated by Food101 is not necessarily settled by the customer's bank.

## Screen 28 — Issue reporting

Support evidence submission for missing or incorrect items, including photos where appropriate.

Flow: Select order → Select issue → Identify affected item(s) → Explain → Upload optional evidence → Submit → Case tracking.

Avoid asking the customer to re-enter information already present in the order.

# 10. Additional operational edge cases

These are the situations that frequently break apparently polished delivery prototypes.

| Scenario                                         | Required system behaviour                                          |
| ------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| Two devices modify same basket                   | Define server-authoritative basket version and conflict resolution |
| Restaurant changes menu mid-session              | Revalidate before checkout                                         |
| User switches addresses                          | Recalculate availability, ETA and fees                             |
| User adds from another restaurant                | Ask before replacing basket                                        |
| User pays twice due to lag                       | Idempotency and transaction reconciliation                         |
| Customer exits payment provider                  | Restore pending payment state                                      |
| Restaurant rejects after payment                 | Notify and begin refund/recovery                                   |
| Rider reassigned                                 | Update identity and tracking                                       |
| ETA unavailable                                  | Show status without invented time                                  |
| Phone battery dies                               | Restore order from server on login                                 |
| App notification arrives late                    | Fetch current state when opened                                    |
| Promo reaches usage limit                        | Revalidate and explain                                             |
| Customer attempts to reuse promo                 | Show eligibility failure                                           |
| Delivery zone changes                            | Revalidate before order submission                                 |
| Restaurant accepts but cannot fulfil an item     | Customer-approved substitution or cancellation/refund              |
| Delivery address needs correction after dispatch | Support-assisted change with feasibility check                     |
| Partial delivery                                 | Record affected items and resolution                               |
| Food is marked delivered incorrectly             | Dispute flow with audit trail                                      |
| Customer requests deletion with active order     | Explain required retention and fulfilment handling                 |
| Service outage                                   | Preserve basket and pending transaction references                 |

